                                        "entry_id": "d8e01153-b702-3b28-886a-39ca3fe03624",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A genre of two-dimensional shoot 'em up in which the playfield is almost filled with a barrage of enemy bullets."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4c003ed-318f-47ab-a971-ae34caa831a5",
                                                "sense_id": "ffed4713-4a19-3a4e-839e-e671f85811d4",
                                                "text": "Mars Matrix is a bullet hell game that is pretty well designed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92f9c6b5-101b-4ace-ad0f-90febfb72335",
                                                "sense_id": "ffed4713-4a19-3a4e-839e-e671f85811d4",
                                                "text": "A few of the game cabinets are connected to flat-screen TVs so bystanders can stop and ogle. Grimy VCRs are hooked up to bullet-hell shooting games..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "536bd400-77ea-4cf2-93d4-aeb01452360d",
                                                "sense_id": "ffed4713-4a19-3a4e-839e-e671f85811d4",
                                                "text": "The camera is a convenient nonviolent replacement for a gun, a principle perhaps taken most literally by Shoot the Bullet (2005), a bullet hell game in which you clear bullets by photographing them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
